OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition kicks off at The
OL,7,     FRichard III in Middleham, where
OL,8,     FKen and Sharon introduce the group
OL,9,     Fto their racehorse Rosairlie.
OL,10,     FThere's just one problem: guest
OL,11,     FMatt is afraid of horses.
OL,12,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FKeith and Lisa Shearin host at the
OL,14,     FCourt House Unique Boutique B&B in
OL,15,     FShelsley Walsh, Worcestershire.
OL,16,     FSome of their guests are blown
OL,17,     Faway by the rooms, but trouble
OL,18,     Fbrews over their rates.
